Fixed the review findings in `35eefc9300f6dd57e7dafd6e57cdc7b4fc88f113`: transient split/fullscreen requests now survive real Chat-to-Dashboard navigation without becoming preferences; legacy layouts remain unchanged; reopening Dashboard uses the latest cross-tab override. Offline/compact restoration and storage-free ordinary renders are covered too.

The previously failing Gateway/UI regressions and 13 Chromium scenarios pass. Swift protocol models were regenerated, and the branch includes the upstream TLS startup correction.

@clawsweeper re-review

Fixed the remaining review paths in `24e5cad804a834339b3558a2cba26ae6a92ce386`: only explicit presentation choices can update the stored override; unrelated layout writes preserve newer cross-tab choices and refresh local metadata. Rail and keyboard now share one opening decision. The reconnect regression also preserves prepared in-memory panels when no saved layout exists.

99 focused tests, 15 Chromium scenarios (including real keyboard input), UI/test type checks, targeted lint, and the production UI size gate pass.

@clawsweeper re-review
